# Frontend (React)

Details: `.cursor/plans/04-frontend-customer-admin.md`.

- React + TypeScript strict, Vite, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, TanStack Query, React Router, RHF + Zod, Vitest + RTL.
- Customer storefront and admin dashboard share API client patterns; role-gate admin routes.
- API base URL from env (`VITE_API_BASE_URL`); never hardcode hosts.
- Prefer small focused components; colocate tests with features.
- Verify with targeted Vitest first, then lint/typecheck/build at phase gates.
